                                                "sense_id": "b340c5e2-968f-3565-bab2-29301ed7d96c",
                                                "text": "He is cowed at the very idea of a cartel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb3f4690-4952-45e8-91e9-6e995c10a7ec",
                                                "sense_id": "b340c5e2-968f-3565-bab2-29301ed7d96c",
                                                "text": "Xerxes whipped the Sea, and writ a cartell of defiance to the hill Athos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a3b47ed-6feb-39bf-a0a4-02b7719ad9bf",
                                        "entry_id": "8435c5ef-41d3-3a2b-8feb-2b1d244b8727",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official agreement concerning the exchange of prisoners."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "684f7911-2174-46b0-85c4-c10a03b2a5db",
                                                "sense_id": "9a3b47ed-6feb-39bf-a0a4-02b7719ad9bf",
                                                "text": "He then sent down a flag of truce in military style, proposing a cartel or exchange of prisoners – the corporal for the notary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92c4c1b5-450b-3705-8cda-358d2df78ce1",
                                        "entry_id": "8435c5ef-41d3-3a2b-8feb-2b1d244b8727",
